      <sectiondef kind="define">
      <memberdef kind="define" id="version_8cuh_1a2b2410557fc1b0da14f3b2ba7c6dc5fb" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>CUB_VERSION</name>
        <initializer>300200</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The preprocessor macro <computeroutput>CUB_VERSION</computeroutput> encodes the version number of the CUB library as MMMmmmpp. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>CUB_VERSION is formatted as <computeroutput>MMMmmmpp</computeroutput>, which differs from <computeroutput>CCCL_VERSION</computeroutput> that uses <computeroutput>MMMmmmppp</computeroutput>. <verbatim>   &lt;tt&gt;CUB_VERSION % 100&lt;/tt&gt; is the sub-minor version.
   &lt;tt&gt;CUB_VERSION / 100 % 1000&lt;/tt&gt; is the minor version.
   &lt;tt&gt;CUB_VERSION / 100000&lt;/tt&gt; is the major version.
</verbatim> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="cub/version.cuh" line="61" column="9" bodyfile="cub/version.cuh" bodystart="61" bodyend="-1"/>
      </memberdef>
      <memberdef kind="define" id="version_8cuh_1a825429c0c66c9beb903dc32bf0d83ae7" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>CUB_MAJOR_VERSION</name>
